{
  "slug": "gc-ai",
  "name": "GC AI",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Work in your GC AI legal knowledge base from Claude: upload documents, run review playbooks, and ask questions grounded in your own files, all as you.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `ask` (Ask a legal question grounded in the user's GC AI knowledge base, optionally against specific documents), `organize-matter` (Group documents into a GC AI project (matter) so later review and questions are scoped to it), `review-document` (Review one or more documents against a GC AI playbook and summarize the findings)\n- **Agents** (1): `gc-ai-analyst` (Autonomously runs a complete GC AI legal task end to end (upload documents, run a review playbook, or…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `gc-ai`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install gc-ai@claude-plugins-official` from `GC-AI-Inc/gc-ai-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
